      "source_title": "Pilot Pricing Guide",
      "effective_date": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "# Pricing\nStandard consultation starts at the published base visit rate. Emergency appointments may include an after-hours surcharge. Membership customers can use the maintenance visit package. Custom discounts require operator approval."
    },
    {
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1",
      "source_document_id": "pilot-service-area",
      "source_title": "Pilot Service Area",
      "effective_date": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "# Service Area\nTenant A serves downtown, northside, west park, river district, and central business district. Tenant A does not serve lakeside or airport neighborhoods."
    },
    {
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1",
      "source_document_id": "pilot-booking",
      "source_title": "Pilot Booking Rules",
      "effective_date": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "# Booking\nSame-day appointments can be offered when the calendar has open slots. Booking requires explicit customer acceptance. The agent may propose a slot but must not book without acceptance."
    },
    {
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1",
      "source_document_id": "pilot-cancellation",
      "source_title": "Pilot Cancellation Policy",
      "effective_date": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "# Cancellation\nCustomers should cancel at least 24 hours before the appointment. Late cancellation exceptions require operator review. Rescheduling follows the same fresh-slot lookup process as booking."
    },
    {
      "tenant_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000b1",
      "source_document_id": "tenant-b-service-area",
      "source_title": "Tenant B Service Area",
      "effective_date": "2026-05-20",
      "text": "# Service Area\nTenant B serves lakeside, airport, and south harbor neighborhoods only."
    }
